#: metabase/llm/settings.clj
msgid "Socket (inter-byte read) timeout in milliseconds for LLM API requests. For streaming responses this bounds the gap between successive chunks, NOT the total response time. Picked generously: extended thinking can pause for tens of seconds between chunks. Without it, a hung read inside the stream blocks the worker indefinitely — observed in production when an upstream proxy held the connection open without sending data."
msgstr "LLM API 请求的 Socket（inter-byte read）timeout（毫秒）。对于流式响应，它限制的是连续 chunks 之间的间隔，而不是总响应时间。此值设置得较宽松：扩展思考可能在 chunks 之间暂停数十秒。没有它时，流内的读取挂起会无限期已阻止工作进程——已在生产环境中观察到：上游代理保持连接打开但不发送数据。"

#: metabase/llm/settings.clj
msgid "TCP connection timeout in milliseconds for LLM API requests. A provider that is down or unreachable should fail fast instead of holding a worker thread forever."
msgstr "LLM API 请求的 TCP connection timeout（毫秒）。当提供方宕机或不可达时，应快速失败，而不是永远占用一个工作进程线程。"

